      lsig_c |     55,202    1.644934           0   1.644934   1.644934
     lsig_e2 |     55,202    .5520405           0   .5520405   .5520405
     lsig_b2 |     55,202    .1518564           0   .1518564   .1518564
-------------+---------------------------------------------------------
